      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">No transfer station in Colac Otway Shire is licensed to take asbestos, and nearly every price you will find online is a Melbourne one. Here is what that means for a Colac fence, roof or farm shed, and what to do before you touch it.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
